sequenceDiagram
    participant Mon as Monitoring
    participant Ops as On-Call
    participant DB as DR Database
    participant CL as DR Cluster
    participant DNS as Global DNS
    participant Test as Smoke Tests

    rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
        Note over Mon,Test: Phase 1 — Detect + Page (2-5 min)
        Mon->>Mon: Primary fails 3 health checks
        Mon->>Ops: PagerDuty P1 alert
        Ops->>Ops: Confirm regional incident
    end

    rect rgb(255, 251, 235)
        Note over Mon,Test: Phase 2 — Promote Data (5-15 min)
        Ops->>DB: Verify replica lag < 60s
        DB-->>Ops: Replica healthy
        Ops->>DB: Promote DR replica
        Note right of DB: RDS promotion / SQL failover group / Cloud SQL promotion
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over Mon,Test: Phase 3 — Bring Up Compute (5-10 min)
        Ops->>CL: Scale serving replicas in DR
        CL-->>Ops: API, workers, OPA ready
        Ops->>CL: Restore secrets and verify bundles
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over Mon,Test: Phase 4 — Cut Over + Verify (6-13 min)
        Ops->>DNS: Move CNAME to DR LB
        DNS-->>Ops: Propagated (TTL 30s)
        Ops->>Test: Run synthetic smoke tests
        Test-->>Ops: All checks pass
        Ops->>Ops: Update status page
    end

    Note over Mon,Test: Total: 23-53 min (within 2h RTO)
